# 詞: 睇怕

1. 睇怕今日都會落雨，你記得帶傘。 (I'm afraid it's going to rain today, remember to bring an umbrella.)
2. 睇怕佢唔會嚟喇，我哋唔好再等。 (I'm afraid he won't come, let's not wait anymore.)
3. 睇怕呢單生意都係做唔成，我哋要另想辦法。 (I'm afraid this deal won't go through, we need to think of another way.)
4. 睇怕你今次考試都係凶多吉少。 (I'm afraid you're in for a rough time with this exam.)
5. 睇怕佢已經知道咗件事，我哋要小心啲講。 (I'm afraid he already knows about it, we need to be careful with what we say.)
6. 睇怕今晚都冇得早啲瞓，仲有咁多嘢要做。 (I'm afraid we won't be able to sleep early tonight, there's still so much to do.)
7. 睇怕呢個計劃都係要延期，因為資金未到位。 (I'm afraid this plan will have to be postponed because the funding isn't in place.)
8. 睇怕佢哋兩個都係唔會和好，始終都係各執一詞。 (I'm afraid the two of them won't reconcile, they're still each sticking to their own story.)
9. 睇怕我哋要重新考慮呢個方案，似乎唔係好可行。 (I'm afraid we need to reconsider this proposal, it doesn't seem very feasible.)
10. 睇怕聽日都係唔會好天，天文台話有颱風嚟緊。 (I'm afraid the weather won't be good tomorrow either, the observatory says a typhoon is coming.) [end of text]


